  message: "2026-11-15: this item is now part of the smart-test plan, ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_plan_11152026.md (section 'Beside the stages: the import-time rule', and owner decision 2 there). Correction to the RELATED line above, which says the faster selection 'may replace this': on the plan's analysis it does not. Selecting by statement cannot shrink an import-time change, because every test that loads a module runs its import-time statements, and a wall-clock budget alone would cut the 1,423 files by ranking rather than by a rule; this item supplies the rule. It is independent of the plan's stages. Still waiting for the owner's go; nothing started. Not measured: how many of the 16 replayed PRs over 60 test-seconds would fit with the narrowed closure."  # 4526
