  message: "2026-11-15: owner said go (in session: 'WI-nusil has my go'; on this item: auto-pr without --gov approved). Starting now on a feature branch. Scope as the description lists: the collector learns whether the importing file is a source file; unit cases split; the bed gains a test file that imports lazily and its assertions state the dropped MUST; ADR-0010 and the module docstring get the measured figure; then the five DONE WHEN checks, each reported with its output. One addition to the lab variant, for the rule as worded ('imports that run when the file is imported'): a decorator or a parameter default of a function in a source module runs at import, so an import written there stays an edge. I will report whether that changes any edge on today's tree."  # 43d8
